   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resursbas ICT4DSPIDER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPIDER is a Swedish resource center for Information and Communication Technology for Development (ICT4D). It is a Swedish network of ICT expertise with partners primarily from the private sector and universities. The SPIDER center acts as a node for networking and coordinates with other ICT actors in Sweden working with ICT4D. SPIDER is located at DSV/Stockholm university in Kista.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPIDER &#xE4;r ett svenskt resurscentrum f&#xF6;r informations-och  kommunikationsteknik f&#xF6;r utveckling (ICT4D). Det &#xE4;r ett svenskt n&#xE4;tverk med expertis inom IT med partners fr&#xE4;mst fr&#xE5;n den privata sektorn och universiteten. SPIDER fungerar som en nod f&#xF6;r n&#xE4;tverk och koordinerar med andra IKT akt&#xF6;rer i Sverige som arbetar med ICT4D SPIDER finns vid Sthlms Universitet/Kista</narrative>
  </description>
